OL,3,GNEWSABuses 'preparing' for anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour on free teen travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of Greater Manchester has
OL,7,Fsaid the city region's combined
OL,8,Fauthority is "preparing" for
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour ahead of the
OL,10,Froll-out of free bus travel for 11 to
OL,11,F16-year-olds.
OL,13,FFrom January, the current Our Pass
OL,14,Fscheme, which gives 16- 18-year-olds
OL,15,Ffree travel on the Bee Network, will be
OL,16,Fextended to children from the age of
OL,17,F11.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
