OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1794597966
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABuses 'preparing' for anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour on free teen travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for Greater Manchester (TfGM)
OL,7,Fconfirmed that it was recruiting 20
OL,8,Fextra travel safe and enforcement
OL,9,Fofficers to support the 121 existing
OL,10,Froles which coincided with the
OL,11,Froll-out.
OL,13,FThe city region's Mayor, Bev Craig said
OL,14,Fthe combined authority had been working
OL,15,Fto make the Bee Network "even safer",
OL,16,Fand that "we trust our young people."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
